<main class="container py-4">
  <section class="hero-banner mb-4">
    <span class="badge bg-light text-success fw-semibold mb-2">De La Salle
      University • College of Computer Studies</span>
    <h1 class="h3 fw-bold mb-2">About AnimoEvents</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 opacity-90">
      A centralized digital bulletin board and personal calendar for
      discovering, bookmarking, and joining campus activities across the DLSU
      Manila and Laguna campuses.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 mb-4">
        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mb-3">Why we built it</h2>
        <p class="small">
          With many student organizations, research centers, and university
          offices operating across the DLSU Manila and Laguna campuses,
          announcements are often spread across social media pages, chat groups,
          and Help Desk Announcement (HDA) emails. It is easy to miss an
          opportunity or lose the registration details in the middle of another
          conversation.
        </p>
        <p class="small mb-2">
          <strong>AnimoEvents</strong>
          brings those details into one place:
        </p>
        <ul class="small mb-0">
          <li class="mb-2">
            <strong>Targeted Campus Feed:</strong>
            Organizers can publish university-wide events or restrict visibility
            to specific roles, student academic levels (Senior High School,
            Undergraduate, Graduate), colleges, departments/strands, and
            campuses.
          </li>
          <li class="mb-2">
            <strong>Direct Registration & Host Updates:</strong>
            Students and faculty can RSVP directly on an event post, view
            available slot capacity, and receive official host updates in the
            event discussion thread.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Saved Bookmarks & Personal Calendar:</strong>
            Users can bookmark events with optional personal notes and track all
            of their registered or hosted activities on a multi-year monthly
            calendar.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

