    <div class="col-lg-5">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 mb-4">
        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mb-3">NPM Packages & Third-Party Libraries</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush small">
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>express</strong>
            — Node.js web application server and modular routing framework.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>express-handlebars</strong>
            — Express view engine for Handlebars templates, layouts, partials,
            and helpers.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>mongoose</strong>
            — MongoDB Object Data Modeling (ODM) library for schemas,
            validation, and queries.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>bcrypt 6</strong>
            — Password salting and hashing through the Mongoose pre-save hook.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>express-session</strong>
            — Server-side session management for authenticated user state.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>express-validator</strong>
            — Server-side request validation and sanitization middleware.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>dotenv</strong>
            — Environment variable loader for database URI and session
            configuration.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item px-0"><strong>Bootstrap 5.3.3</strong>
            — Responsive front-end layout grid, navigation bar, cards, and
            modals. The bundle includes Popper for dropdown placement.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

